{"title":"초저녁의 노래","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:QlMYHFeI14Rfs5h0ly9e","sourceHash":"d8cef42cc0e063e7d027f85b7f1b0048e8e3fdf313b75f76f73f5705aadcf79f","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":5.91,"end":8.91,"text":"【そして、【第七の喜劇】は】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":9.74,"end":12.74,"text":"【繰り返され続けるだろう】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":20.06,"end":23.06,"text":"『Sieben』「この身を 灼き尽くすのは」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":23.42,"end":26.42,"text":"『Sechs』「浄化を謳う 欺瞞の炎」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":26.73,"end":29.73,"text":"『Funf』「この心を 灼き尽くすのは」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":30.03,"end":33.03,"text":"『Vier』「復讐を唄う 憎しみの炎」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.12,"end":36.12,"text":"『Drei』「飢餓と闇 疑心と殺戮」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":36.47,"end":39.42,"text":"『Zwei』「イドの底に潜む 暗黒の時代よ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":39.42,"end":42.42,"text":"『Eins』「黒き死の如く 連鎖していけ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":42.44,"end":45.44,"text":"「メル、地獄へ墜ちても」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":53.73,"end":56.73,"text":"【この物語は虚構である】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":60.18,"end":62.45,"text":"【然し、その総てが】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":62.45,"end":65.45,"text":"【虚構であるとは限らない】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":72.6,"end":74.74,"text":"【そして今】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":74.74,"end":77.74,"text":"【此の地平に宵闇が訪れた】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":79.3,"end":82.3,"text":"【終焉へと疾りだす】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":82.67,"end":85.67,"text":"【夜の復讐劇】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":86.98,"end":89.98,"text":"【第七の地平線】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":110.28,"end":112.8,"text":"私は 誰なのか?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":112.8,"end":115.53999999999999,"text":"記述が 抜け落ちた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":115.53999999999999,"end":118.28,"text":"真っ白な 其の 頁(紙)を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":118.28,"end":120.87,"text":"宵闇が 染めてゆく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":120.87,"end":123.57,"text":"気付けば 井戸の底","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":123.57,"end":126.22,"text":"空を 見上げていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":126.22,"end":128.85,"text":"抱いていた 可愛い 少女","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":128.85,"end":131.85,"text":"口を 開いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":131.93,"end":134.87,"text":"「フフ、愛シテルワ、メル」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":134.87,"end":137.87,"text":"「コレデ 私達 ズットズーット 一緒ネ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":141.91,"end":144.56,"text":"復讐シヨウと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":144.56,"end":147.28,"text":"彼女が 囁く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":147.28,"end":149.84,"text":"その声色は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":149.84,"end":152.3,"text":"何処か 懐かしく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":152.3,"end":155.05,"text":"何の為か なんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":155.05,"end":157.57,"text":"誰の為か なんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":157.57,"end":160.22,"text":"憶い出せぬ 儘","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":160.22,"end":162.98,"text":"衝動に 従った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":162.98,"end":165.57,"text":"苦痛に 歪む 顔","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":165.57,"end":168.4,"text":"悲痛に 喚く 声","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":168.4,"end":171.4,"text":"戦慄と 後悔の 中で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":172.62,"end":175.62,"text":"嗚呼 復讐は 罪が故に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":175.71,"end":178.23,"text":"粛々と 受け入れ 給え","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":178.23,"end":181.23,"text":"嘆いた処で もう手遅れさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":182.69,"end":185.69,"text":"遂に モリから イドヘ至る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":186.37,"end":188.93,"text":"喜劇の 幕は上がった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":188.93,"end":191.93,"text":"七人の 女優達よ!(シャオ シュピーレ リンネン)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":192.34,"end":195.34,"text":"「さぁ、美しすぎる 屍人姫に ご登場願おうか」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":196.95,"end":199.61,"text":"「Drei Zwei Eins Los!」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":199.61,"end":202.32,"text":"死せる 今 幾ら憾めど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":202.32,"end":204.95,"text":"刻は 既に遅く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":204.95,"end":206.3,"text":"お嬢さん(フロイライン)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":206.3,"end":207.55,"text":"君は独り(ドゥ ビスト アライン)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":207.55,"end":210.32999999999998,"text":"夜の 旅路 彷徨う 屍体","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":210.32999999999998,"end":212.98,"text":"偶然に 出逢った 物語","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":212.98,"end":215.62,"text":"嗚呼 此れも 運命","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":215.62,"end":216.94,"text":"小さな口","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":216.94,"end":218.42000000000002,"text":"七の苦悩 (ズィーベン パイン)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":218.42000000000002,"end":221.42000000000002,"text":"忘れぬ間に 紡ぎなさい さぁ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":226.34,"end":229.34,"text":"「Kam kam Die Nacht kam」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":229.92000000000002,"end":232.92000000000002,"text":"「Das Siebent Marchen la la la」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":236.64,"end":239.64,"text":"「Kam kam Die Nacht kam」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":240.68,"end":243.68,"text":"「Das Siebent Marchen la la la」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":255.31,"end":258.18,"text":"墓場から 始まる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":258.18,"end":260.78,"text":"七つの 童話","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":260.78,"end":263.35,"text":"イドの底に 潜む","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":263.35,"end":265.74,"text":"矛盾の 罠","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":265.74,"end":268.49,"text":"物語の 策者は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":268.49,"end":271.15,"text":"作為的な 嘘で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":271.15,"end":274.15,"text":"錯落なる 幻想を 紡ぐ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":275.82,"end":278.82,"text":"光と闇が織り成す 世界の中に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":281.1,"end":284.1,"text":"愛と 憎悪が 溢れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":287.25,"end":290.25,"text":"誰かを かつて 愛したような 気がした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":293.22,"end":296.22,"text":"憎しみの 焔は 揺れ躍る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":298.63,"end":301.63,"text":"誰かに 愛されたような 気もした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":303.85,"end":306.85,"text":"嗚呼 でも それは 気のせいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":309.68,"end":312.68,"text":"キミが 誰かを 怨むなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":314.55,"end":317.55,"text":"その復讐に 手を貸そう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":320.78,"end":323.78,"text":"「Kam kam Die Nacht kam」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":324.05,"end":327.05,"text":"「Das Siebent Marchen la la la」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":370.05,"end":372.5,"text":"「黒き死を遡るかのように」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":372.5,"end":374.9,"text":"「旋律は東を目指す」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81